Root cause:
The test method navigated to a `ViewThemePage` (stored in `themePage`) but mistakenly called `waitUntilPreviewIsLoaded()` on a stale/incorrect `editThemePage` object (an instance of `EditThemePage`) instead of the current `themePage` object. Since the actual page displayed was `ViewThemePage`, invoking the wait method on `editThemePage` did not correctly check the preview loading state on the correct page, and in the exception recovery block, the code incorrectly reinitialized `editThemePage` as a new `EditThemePage()` instead of reinitializing `themePage` as a new `ViewThemePage()`. This variable/type mismatch caused the retry logic to operate on the wrong page object, leading to incorrect or failed validation of the theme preview loading.

